  "kind": "object",
  "type": "hud",
  "name": "Run HUD",
  "notes": "Top: a deep indigo panel across the screen (the same color and white edge as the pause box, with a dark outline under it) holding the HP bar (green, yellow at half, red at a quarter; its length follows the max HP), the level and kills, the XP bar to the next level and the run timer. Bottom: the 3 moves as big A, B and R letters, each right next to its charge circle (a padlock while locked, a white blink when it becomes ready). No panel at the bottom, so the world stays in view there.",
